OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters demand more mental
OL,4,Ahealth support amid suicide rate
OL,5,Aconcerns
OL,6,
OL,7,FCampaigners are calling for better
OL,8,Fmental health support on the Isle of
OL,9,FMan amid concerns about the island's
OL,10,Fsuicide rate.
OL,12,FAbout 30 people attended the protest
OL,13,Foutside Tynwald, organised by ManxPACT.
OL,15,FA government committee report published
OL,16,Fin July found that between 2021 and
OL,17,F2023, the island's suicide rate
OL,18,Faveraged 13.9 deaths per 100,000 people
OL,19,Feach year, compared with 10.7 in
OL,20,FEngland.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
