OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters demand more mental
OL,4,Ahealth support amid suicide rate
OL,5,Aconcerns
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe group wants mental health funding
OL,8,Fto match UK levels and a community hub
OL,9,Fin each region. It is also calling for
OL,10,Fa duty clinician scheme, so a qualified
OL,11,Fprofessional is always available to
OL,12,Fassess people who contact the crisis
OL,13,Fteam.
